  "content": "<p>這是針對<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-ore-excavation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Ore Excavation</a>模組的子模組，讓鑽頭更難取得鑽石和綠寶石。我這樣做是因為原本的設定有點過於強勢。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>將原始綠寶石和鑽石轉換為普通綠寶石和鑽石的方法如下：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span>1. 將原始鑽石與50mB水混合，獲得加熱原始鑽石或鑽石粉<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AhMH6Zj.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"428\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span>1.5 使用16個鑽石粉獲得原始鑽石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S867Pxk.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"732\" height=\"432\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>2. 清洗加熱原始鑽石獲得洗淨原始鑽石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sWLxlgs.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"306\"><br>3. 切割洗淨原始鑽石獲得切割原始鑽石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ph4bGBt.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"311\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>4. 壓制切割原始鑽石獲得壓制原始鑽石</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oZIZ7wb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"742\" height=\"312\"><br>5. 拋光壓制原始鑽石獲得鑽石<br></span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jHWph32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"744\" height=\"255\"></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>將原始紅石轉換為普通紅石的方式也有些微調整：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>1. 粉碎原始紅石</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ssdJpbe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"741\" height=\"433\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>2. 將粉碎紅石注入100mB水</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/meSCZLe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"312\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>獄髓的處理方式略有不同：<br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span>1. 鑽取原始獄髓碎片</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hvros7o.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"728\" height=\"422\"><br>2. 熔燒原始獄髓碎片獲得燒製獄髓碎片</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ezb6xBY.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"738\" height=\"310\"><br>3. 附靈燒製獄髓碎片獲得附靈原始獄髓碎片</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KEuPGLS.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"734\" height=\"310\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>4. 煙燻附靈原始獄髓碎片獲得煙燻獄髓碎片</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mc7MeLo.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"311\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>5. 將煙燻獄髓碎片與岩漿混合獲得熔岩獄髓碎片</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SOZ6Pf8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"430\"><br>6. 潑灑熔岩獄髓碎片獲得獄髓碎片</span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XYm7Crz.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"733\" height=\"307\"></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>新增透過壓制獄髓碎片與黃金製作獄髓錠的功能。<br><br>採集獄髓必須使用終極鑽頭，製作方式如下：<br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Y4oeDLq.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"729\" height=\"445\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>&nbsp;現在也可以使用流體抽取器從主世界和地獄抽取岩漿。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
